Modifications made by Solnest AI on top of upstream v2.2.4:

  - scripts/parse_html.py: link analysis was gated behind an optional --url
    flag and reported "0" internal and external links when it was omitted,
    which reads as "this page has no links" rather than "this was not
    measured". It now falls back to the page's own canonical or og:url, and
    reports "not analyzed" when no base URL can be determined.

  - skills/seo-geo/SKILL.md and agents/seo-geo.md: added Claude-SearchBot,
    corrected the training-crawler versus search-crawler distinction for
    OpenAI and Anthropic, noted that Google-Extended has no effect on Google
    AI Overviews, and added edge/CDN verification guidance.

  - Branding, documentation, and plugin manifests.
